00:00:19.786 --> 00:00:21.320 line:0%
You have the lyrics
in front of you,

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:22.488 line:0%
but when the music drops out,

00:00:22.488 --> 00:00:24.924
you have to finish
the line from memory.

00:00:24.924 --> 00:00:26.793
If you don't get
the lyrics exactly right,

00:00:26.793 --> 00:00:28.727
those microphones will spray you

00:00:28.727 --> 00:00:31.397
