with water.

00:00:31.397 --> 00:00:32.731
I apologize.

00:00:32.731 --> 00:00:35.869
But if you can slay it and sing
all the words perfectly,

00:00:35.869 --> 00:00:38.004
then your opponents
get drenched instead.

00:00:38.004 --> 00:00:39.071
-Oh, man, we're screwed.

00:00:39.071 --> 00:00:41.173
-Each song is worth
50,000 points.

00:00:41.173 --> 00:00:43.910
All right, Patti and Billy,
your team is up first.

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:45.545
Let's see what song you get.

